\u00e0 r\u1ed3i ra v\u01b0\u1eddn. Ph\u00eda sau nh\u00e0 c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng b\u1eadc thang \u0111\u00e1 c\u0169 d\u1eabn l\u00ean c\u0103n ph\u00f2ng kh\u00f3a k\u00edn. Tr\u00ean \u0111\u1ec9nh c\u1ea7u thang c\u00f3 \u00e1nh \u0111\u00e8n.`},{`en`:`[[The]] [[door]] [[at]] [[the]] [[top]] [[was|be]] [[open]]. [[Inside]], [[a]] [[boy]] [[sat|sit]] [[at]] an [[old]] [[piano]]. [[It]] [[was|be]] Vinh, [[the]] [[quiet]] [[boy]] [[from]] [[number]] 15. [[He]] [[jumped|jump]] [[up]], [[red]] [[in]] [[the]] [[face]]. \`I'm [[sorry]]! I'm [[not]] [[a]] [[thief]]!\``,`vn`:`C\u00e1nh c\u1eeda tr\u00ean \u0111\u1ec9nh \u0111ang m\u1edf. B\u00ean trong, m\u1ed9t c\u1eadu b\u00e9 \u0111ang ng\u1ed3i b\u00ean c\u00e2y \u0111\u00e0n piano c\u0169. \u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 Vinh, c\u1eadu b\u00e9 \u00edt n\u00f3i \u1edf s\u1ed1 15. C\u1eadu b\u1eadt d\u1eady, m\u1eb7t \u0111\u1ecf b\u1eebng. \`Anh xin l\u1ed7i! Anh kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i k\u1ebb tr\u1ed9m \u0111\u00e2u!\``},{`en`:`[[He]] [[showed|show]] Quang [[a]] [[key]] [[and]] [[a]] [[letter]]. \`[[This]] [[was|be]] Mrs Xuan's [[house]], [[and]] [[she]] [[was|be]] [[my]] [[piano]] [[teacher]]. [[Now]] [[she]] [[lives|live]] [[in]] Da Lat.\` [[The]] [[letter]] [[said|say]]: \`[[Dear]] Vinh, [[please]] [[play]] [[my]] [[piano]] [[every]] [[night]], [[so]] [[it]] [[is|be]] [[not]] [[sad]]. [[And]] [[please]] [[water]] [[my]] [[plant]].\``,`vn`:`C\u1eadu \u0111\u01b0a Quang xem m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc ch\u00eca kh\u00f3a v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u00e1 th\u01b0. \`\u0110\u00e2y t\u1eebng l\u00e0 nh\u00e0 c\u1ee7a b\u00e0 Xu\u00e2n, c\u00f4 gi\u00e1o d\u1ea1y piano c\u1ee7a anh. Gi\u1edd b\u00e0 s\u1ed1ng \u1edf \u0110\u00e0 L\u1ea1t.\` L\u00e1 th\u01b0 vi\u1ebft: \`Vinh th\u00e2n m\u1ebfn, ch\u00e1u h\u00e3y ch\u01a1i \u0111\u00e0n c\u1ee7a b\u00e0 m\u1ed7i t\u1ed1i, \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e2y \u0111\u00e0n kh\u1ecfi bu\u1ed3n. V\u00e0 nh\u1edb t\u01b0\u1edbi ch\u1eadu c\u00e2y gi\u00fap b\u00e0 nh\u00e9.\``},{`en`:`[[So]] [[that]] [[was|be]] [[the]] [[music]], [[the]] [[light]] [[and]] [[the]] [[wet]] [[plant]]! [[Now]] Mum, Dad [[and]] Uyen [[were|be]] [[there]] [[too]]. \`[[Why]] [[at]] [[midnight]]?\` [[asked|ask]] Mum. Vinh [[looked|look]] [[at]] [[the]] [[floor]]. \`[[I]] [[play]] [[badly]]. [[I]] didn't [[want]] [[anybody]] [[to]] [[hear]].\` \`[[Badly]]?\` [[said|say]] Dad. \`[[You]] [[play]] [[very]] [[well]].\``,`vn`:`H\u00f3a ra \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0 ti\u1ebfng \u0111\u00e0n, \u00e1nh \u0111\u00e8n v\u00e0 ch\u1eadu c\u00e2y l\u00fac n\u00e0o c\u0169ng \u01b0\u1edbt! L\u00fac n\u00e0y, b\u1ed1, m\u1eb9 v\u00e0 Uy\u00ean c\u0169ng \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 m\u1eb7t. \`Sao l\u1ea1i l\u00e0 n\u1eeda \u0111\u00eam h\u1ea3 ch\u00e1u?\` m\u1eb9 h\u1ecfi. Vinh nh\u00ecn xu\u1ed1ng s\u00e0n. \`Ch\u00e1u ch\u01a1i d\u1edf l\u1eafm \u1ea1. Ch\u00e1u kh\u00f4ng mu\u1ed1n ai nghe th\u1ea5y.\` \`D\u1edf \u00e1?\` b\u1ed1 n\u00f3i. \`Ch\u00e1u ch\u01a1i hay l\u1eafm.\``},{`en`:`Dad [[gave|give]] Vinh [[a]] [[key]] [[to]] [[the]] [[front]] [[door]]. \`[[Come]] [[before]] [[dinner]],\` [[he]] [[said|say]]. \`[[Midnight]] [[is|be]] [[for]] [[sleeping|sleep]].\` Uyen [[pulled|pull]] Vinh's [[hand]]. \`[[Can]] [[you]] [[teach]] [[me]]? Miu [[wants|want]] [[to]] [[learn]] [[too]].\``,`vn`:`B\u1ed1 \u0111\u01b0a cho Vinh ch\u00eca kh\u00f3a c\u1eeda tr\u01b0\u1edbc. \`Ch\u00e1u c\u1ee9 \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u01b0\u1edbc gi\u1edd \u0103n t\u1ed1i nh\u00e9,\` b\u1ed1 n\u00f3i. \`N\u1eeda \u0111\u00eam l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 ng\u1ee7.\` Uy\u00ean k\u00e9o tay Vinh. \`Anh d\u1ea1y em \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng? Miu c\u0169ng mu\u1ed1n h\u1ecdc n\u1eefa.\``},{`en`:`Vinh [[smiled|smile]] [[for]] [[the]] [[first]] [[time]]. [[Then]] Quang [[had|have]] an [[idea]]. \`[[The]] Mid-Autumn [[Festival]] [[is|be]] [[next]] [[month]]. [[Can]] [[you]] [[play]] [[for]] [[the]] [[whole]] [[street]]?\` Vinh's [[face]] [[went|go]] [[white]] [[again]].`,`vn`:`L\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, Vinh m\u1ec9m c\u01b0\u1eddi. R\u1ed3i Quang n\u1ea3y ra m\u